      "initial_variations": "Both columns startxi=0; coordinate theta/phi derivative1/r0 is converted by original SetJacobiColumn to covariantDxi/dlambda.",
      "metric": "Schwarzschild M=1,E=1,r0=10,theta=pi/2; original covariantp=(-1,1.25,0,0).",
      "work": "Exactly2000 originalRK4steps of1e-3 to lambda2; everyStep mustsucceed."
    }
